} ARES executes the calculator and gets 2528.27 ARES sends the result back to the LLM The LLM produces a final text response incorporating the calculated value User receives: { "content": "The monthly payment on a $400,000 mortgage at 6.5% APR over 30 years would be **$2,528.27**.\n\nThis is calculated using the standard amortization formula...", "model": "llama-3.3-70b", "tokens_used": 412
} The tool-calling steps are invisible to the caller. You send a question and receive a complete answer.

